  "content": "<table style=\"width:100%\">\n  <tbody><tr>\n    <td style=\"width:124px;text-align:center\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex\">\n        <img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/zipestudio.png?raw=true\">\n      </div>\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      <div style=\"display:flex\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/block-dithering\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n            <img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/github.png?raw=true\">\n          </a>\n          <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fblock-dithering\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n            <img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/modrinth.png?raw=true\">\n          </a>\n          <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/block-dithering\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n            <img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/curseforge.png?raw=true\">\n          </a>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex\">\n          <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fXmGF7rkkuY\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n            <img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/discord.png?raw=true\">\n          </a>\n          <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ft.me%252fzipeleaf\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n            <img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/telegram.png?raw=true\">\n          </a>\n          <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fzipestudio%252ftip\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n            <img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/support.png?raw=true\">\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody></table><p><img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/ZSdescription.png?raw=true\" alt=\"&quot;Description&quot; Title\"></p><p><strong>區塊抖動透明</strong> — 為擋住視線的方塊添加抖動透明效果，靠近時逐漸淡出，不再阻礙視野，但從遠處看仍與原版一模一樣。<br>\n<strong>相容所有光影與資源包！✨</strong></p><h3>展示</h3><p><img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/block-dithering/blob/master/assets/showcase.png?raw=true\" alt=\"showcase\">\n<img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/block-dithering/blob/master/assets/showcase_vault.png?raw=true\" alt=\"showcase vault\">\n<img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/block-dithering/blob/master/assets/showcase_vanilla.png?raw=true\" alt=\"showcase vanilla\"></p><span><span><iframe width=\"854\" height=\"480\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/TkUQwcnswHw\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><p><img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/ZScompatible.png?raw=true\" alt=\"&quot;Compatibility&quot; Title\"></p><ul>\n<li>可在原版渲染及 <strong>Sodium</strong> 與 <strong>Iris</strong> 中正常運作</li>\n<li><strong>僅限用戶端</strong> — 支援多人遊戲，伺服器無需安裝</li>\n</ul><h3>🌟 光影相容</h3><p>別擔心，此模組可與所有光影搭配，包含來自資源包或 Iris 的光影！您無需進行任何操作——只需啟用光影，它就會自動生效。</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/block-dithering/blob/master/assets/shaders.gif?raw=true\" width=\"100%\" alt=\"shaders\"></p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/block-dithering/blob/master/assets/resourcepacks.png?raw=true\" alt=\"resourcepacks\"></p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/ZSconfigurable.png?raw=true\" alt=\"&quot;Configurable&quot; Title\"></p><ul>\n<li>完全可設定的方塊列表：支援<strong>白名單</strong>與<strong>黑名單</strong>功能，可使用 <code>id</code>、<code>#tag</code> 或 <code>*萬用字元*</code><ul>\n<li>例如：<code>minecraft:glass</code>、<code>#minecraft:flowers</code>、<code>minecraft:*copper_grate*</code></li></ul></li>\n<li>遊戲內設定畫面（YACL），附有淡出距離、像素大小與最低可見度滑桿</li>\n<li>可搜尋的方塊列表與即時套用——無需重新載入或重啟</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/block-dithering/blob/master/assets/general_settings.png?raw=true\" alt=\"general settings\">\n<img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/block-dithering/blob/master/assets/whitelist_settings.png?raw=true\" alt=\"whitelist settings\">\n<img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/block-dithering/blob/master/assets/blacklist_settings.png?raw=true\" alt=\"blacklist settings\"></p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/ZSsupport.png?raw=true\" alt=\"&quot;Support&quot; Title\"></p><h3>想支持模組與作者？只需向大家推薦這個模組！</h3><p>沒錯，您沒看錯。只要宣傳，您就是在支持這個模組與創作者。越多人知道這個模組，下載量就越高；下載量越高，作者就會更有動力，同時網站收入也會增加（簡直就是免費贊助）。<strong>請記住，宣傳不可造成困擾或惱人！</strong></p><h3>您可以做些什麼？</h3><ul>\n<li>製作影片評論/廣告</li>\n<li>在社群媒體或 Discord 上分享</li>\n<li>告訴朋友這個模組</li>\n<li>將它加入您的模組包，或直接下載享受遊戲</li>\n</ul><blockquote>\n  <p>每一次提及都很重要——感謝您幫助社群成長 🤍</p>\n</blockquote><p><img src=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/Vault/blob/main/design/mods/main/ZSlicensing.png?raw=true\" alt=\"&quot;Licensing&quot; Title\"></p><p>本專案的授權條款定義於原始碼儲存庫中的 <a href=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/block-dithering/blob/master/LICENSE.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LICENSE</a> 檔案。該檔案始終優先於任何其他地方顯示的授權。</p><h3><a href=\"https://github.com/ZipeStudio/block-dithering\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">檢視原始碼</a></h3>",
